Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.91,0:23:12.41,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn华康娃娃体W5-A\fs180\bord9\shad9\c&H89FFFE&\3c&H1D3A52&\4c&H35C4F8&\pos(466.571,660.143)}高原的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.98,0:07:47.15,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn@萝莉体\fs120\fr-75\bord3\c&H3192F4&\3c&H305FC5&\pos(646,291)}咕噜噜...
